# Muse / Meta personal routing rules
# Evidence, optional hosts and known gaps: docs/Muse-Network-Audit.md
# A: core service / authentication
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com

# B: app preview origins explicitly handled by current Muse JavaScript
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecto1usercontent.com

# B: explicit production / voice hosts in current Muse JavaScript
DOMAIN,production.museai.com
DOMAIN,voice.museai.com

# B: authentication routes explicitly accepted by current Muse JavaScript
# Side effect: these entire hosts also serve Facebook / Instagram pages.
DOMAIN,www.facebook.com
DOMAIN,www.instagram.com

# A/B: exact CDN hosts in public Meta auth HTML / Muse resource loader
# Side effect: other Meta apps using these same hosts share this policy.
DOMAIN,static.xx.fbcdn.net
DOMAIN,nest-static.fbcdn.net
